      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between gap-3 flex-wrap">
        <div>
          <small>VERTICAL SLICE #1</small>
          <h2>Tokenized Equity</h2>
          <p><strong>H1</strong> Equity ↔ Tokenized Equity dislocation · <strong>H2</strong> cross-venue tokenized-equity arbitrage.</p>
          <p>Gross spread is only a candidate. Opportunities survive data quality, economic relationship, fees, liquidity and deterministic risk gates before paper execution.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="badge text-bg-warning">PAPER</span>
          <span class="badge text-bg-danger">LIVE OFF</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% set researchPack = w.hypothesis_research|default({}) %}
    {% set hypotheses = researchPack.hypotheses|default({}) %}
    <section class="cos-panel">
      <h2>Hypothesis evidence</h2>
      <p>Verdicts are deterministic and sample-gated. A positive spread is not promoted to truth merely because a chart looked persuasive at 02:00.</p>
      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Hypothesis</th><th>Verdict</th><th>Observable scans</th><th>Unobservable</th><th>Detected</th><th>Executable</th><th>Attempts</th><th>Realized</th><th>Invalidated</th><th>Completion</th><th>Avg expected P&amp;L</th><th>Avg realized / attempt</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
          {% for code in ['H1','H2'] %}
            {% set h = attribute(hypotheses, code)|default({}) %}
            {% set sample = h.sample|default({}) %}
            {% set economics = h.economics|default({}) %}
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{{ code }}</strong></td>
              <td><strong>{{ h.verdict|default('INSUFFICIENT_DATA') }}</strong></td>
              <td>{{ sample.scan_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.unobservable_scan_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.detected_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.executable_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.execution_attempt_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.realized_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ sample.invalidated_execution_count|default(0) }}</td>
              <td>{{ economics.completion_rate|default('0') }}</td>
              <td>{{ economics.average_expected_pnl|default('0') }}</td>
              <td>{{ economics.average_realized_pnl_per_attempt|default('0') }}</td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p><small>Edge Funnel: observable scan → detected candidate → executable opportunity → execution attempt → realized or invalidated result. Unobservable scans are tracked separately and never count as proof of no edge. H1 remains execution-closed until a real hedge venue exists.</small></p>
    </section>

    <section class="cos-panel">
      <h2>Paper portfolio</h2>
      {% if portfolio %}
        <div class="row g-3">
